\li1 \w and 1,000|strong="H505"\w* \w other|strong="H312"\w* \w articles|strong="H3627"\w*.
\p \v 11 \w In all, there were|strong="H3605"\w* \w 5,400|strong="H2568"\w* \w . . .|strong="H505"\w* \w . . .|strong="H702"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3967"\w* \w gold|strong="H2091"\w* \w and silver|strong="H3701"\w* \w articles|strong="H3627"\w*. \w Sheshbazzar|strong="H8339"\w* \w brought|strong="H5927"\w* \w all [these]|strong="H3605"\w* \w along|strong="H5973"\w* \w when the exiles|strong="H1473"\w* \w went up|strong="H5927"\w* \w from Babylon|strong="H894"\w* \w to Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*.
