\p \v 1 \w After these things|strong="H428"\w* \w had been accomplished|strong="H3615"\w*, \w the leaders|strong="H8269"\w* \w approached|strong="H5066"\w* \w me|strong="H413"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w The people|strong="H5971"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w including the priests|strong="H3548"\w* \w and Levites|strong="H3881"\w*, \w have not|strong="H3808"\w* \w kept themselves separate|strong="H914"\w* \w from the surrounding|strong="H776"\w* \w peoples|strong="H5971"\w* \w whose abominations|strong="H8441"\w* \w are like those of the Canaanites|strong="H3669"\w*, \w Hittites|strong="H2850"\w*, \w Perizzites|strong="H6522"\w*, \w Jebusites|strong="H2983"\w*, \w Ammonites|strong="H5984"\w*, \w Moabites|strong="H4125"\w*, \w Egyptians|strong="H4713"\w*, \w and Amorites|strong="H567"\w*. \v 2 \w Indeed|strong="H3588"\w*, \w the Israelites have taken|strong="H5375"\w* \w some of their daughters [as wives]|strong="H1323"\w* for themselves \w and their sons|strong="H1121"\w*, \w so that the holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w seed|strong="H2233"\w* \w has been mixed|strong="H6148"\w* \w with the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w of the land|strong="H776"\w*. \w And the leaders|strong="H8269"\w* \w and officials|strong="H5461"\w* \w have taken the lead|strong="H3027"\w* \w . . .|strong="H1961"\w* \w . . .|strong="H7223"\w* \w in this|strong="H2088"\w* \w unfaithfulness|strong="H4604"\w*!”
